      "content": "thanks for the reply. i'm just worried because i've been feeling a bit more jittery than usual since starting the sertraline. do u think the jitters could be because of the cough syrup or is that just the anxiety meds? and like, is there really a big risk if i take a standard dose or something? i just really need to sleep through this cough",
